Add state reset methods to form extension slot singletons.

FilePersistenceSlot and ResourcePublicationSlot are SingletonInterface
services that accumulate per-request state. Under long-running
runtimes FilePersistenceSlot's whitelisted file operations and
ResourcePublicationSlot's tracked file identifiers leak between
requests — the former is a cross-user security issue.

Add public methods to clear the accumulated state.

--- a/Classes/Slot/FilePersistenceSlot.php
+++ b/Classes/Slot/FilePersistenceSlot.php
@@ -47,6 +47,17 @@
 
     public function __construct(private readonly HashService $hashService) {}
 
+    /**
+     * Clears all allowed file operation invocations.
+     *
+     * Useful for long-running PHP runtimes where the singleton persists
+     * across requests and whitelisted operations must not leak.
+     */
+    public function clearAllowedInvocations(): void
+    {
+        $this->allowedInvocations = [];
+    }
+
     public function getContentSignature(string $content): string
     {
         return $this->hashService->hmac($content, self::class);

